5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Hello everyone. Since our household has grown, it seems only logical to update our billing system. I believe we should aim for a method that is sustainable and avoids any future friction. What do you all think?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I totally agree, Benjamin! It's getting a bit chaotic, isn't it? I want something that's easy for everyone and doesn't take forever to figure out every single month. Let's make it simple!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. It would be wise to ensure the system is fair for everyone. I think we should look into the actual usage to avoid any misunderstandings or feelings of imbalance among us.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree that we need a sustainable system. However, I believe it is crucial to understand our actual spending patterns over a full year before we commit to a new arrangement. We should be cautious about any upfront costs.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I agree with everyone. I just hope we can find a way to talk about money without it making us feel sad or angry with each other. I want us all to stay happy friends.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It is heartening to see we are all in agreement. To ensure our logic is sound, perhaps we should examine our historical costs and the actual effort required to manage the administration. Shall we decide what to investigate?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"That sounds like a great plan! I'm really curious about how much work the paperwork actually is. If we can find a way to make it super quick, that would be amazing for everyone!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I think it would be beneficial to see the plug-in monitor readings room by room. It would provide objective data on who is using what, which helps prevent any lingering resentment.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with Jonathan's point on objectivity. To ensure we have a complete picture, I would like to see the last twelve utility statements and the electrician's quote for the rooms.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I want to know why people get upset. Can I see the payment log for the last twelve months and the settling up when the last rooms filled? Maybe that will help us understand.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent approach. I shall look into the last twelve utility statements to understand our spending patterns, and the sunlight and heating need by room to ensure we don't overlook winter comfort.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll check out the trial run of a reconciliation template to see if it saves time! I also want to see the monthly settle observed at another house for some fresh ideas!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the plug-in monitor readings room by room and the payment log for the last twelve months. I believe these will help us establish a fair and transparent baseline.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will stick with my previous suggestions. I'll look into the last twelve utility statements to analyze our annual costs and the electrician's quote for the rooms to check for any potential upfront expenses.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'll look into the payment log for the last twelve months and the settling up when the last rooms filled. I want to see if there are patterns that make people feel bad.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we have a comprehensive list of investigations. By combining our findings on historical costs, administrative effort, and individual usage, we should be able to construct a system that is both fair and effortless.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited to see what we find! I really hope we can find a way to make the monthly chores a breeze so we have more time to hang out together!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I look forward to seeing the results. Having clear, objective data will allow us to move forward with a system that everyone can trust and feel comfortable with.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. Once we have the data, we can evaluate the options based on financial stability and feasibility. I look forward to seeing if the costs are as volatile as they feel.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,I hope the things I find can help us be kinder to each other. I'm looking forward to hearing what everyone else discovers too. Let's make this a happy change for all of us!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
